      "id": "L9dzcc",
      "title": "MCP",
      "content": "zeetawebはMCPに対応しています。\n1ツリーが1MCPサーバになります。\n登録方法は、[こちらを参照してください](https://zeetaweb.jp/help?tab=mcp)。\n\n## 使い方の例\n- 「MCP zeeta01に接続して、Sample treeに何があるか教えて」\n    - zeeta01は、登録時に指定したMCP名\n- 「このexcelファイルをzeeta01に記録して」\n    - ノード階層を指定しなくても適度に分割する場合もありますが、「1シートは、1ノードにすること」のように伝えた方が確実です。\n- 「MCP (id:L9dzcc)を確認して」\n    - ノードを選択してコピー、エディタなどにペーストすると「{ノード名}(id:xxxxxx)」というテキストになります。\n    - id:xxxxxxが入っているとAIは、直接ノードを参照できます。\n    - 逆に入っていないと、ノード名で検索することになり、無駄に時間と手間がかかります。",
      "sortMode": "manual",
      "sortDirection": "asc"
    },
    {
      "id": "PgwtVZ",
      "title": "hello",
      "content": "# Hello\nThis sample tree lets you try zeeta for yourself. Delete it when you no longer need it.\n\nzeetaweb is a tool for organizing text in a tree structure. Its distinguishing feature is that a node can have multiple parents. See the “Sample tree” node for examples.\n\nFor instructions on using the interface, see the [“?” icon](https://zeetaweb.jp/help.html?tab=editor) in the header.\n\n# Public repository\n(Under construction)\n\n# Important information\nzeetaweb (\"the Service\") is an individually operated trial for trying out trees in which a node can have multiple parents. By using it, you agree to the following.\n\n- **No guarantee of data preservation.** We do not guarantee that your data will be preserved or recoverable, or that the Service will remain available. Data may be lost or corrupted.\n- **Keep your own copies.** Keep separate copies of anything you cannot afford to lose.\n- **Do not put confidential information in your trees.** Do not enter passwords, customer information, or other confidential or personal information that would cause harm if disclosed.\n- **Things may change.** Features and screens may be changed or discontinued, and the Service itself may end.\n- **Prohibited conduct.** You must not access the Service without authorization, infringe others' rights, place excessive load on the Service, or violate applicable law.\n- **Liability.** Liability for any loss or damage is governed by applicable law.\n\nFor details, see the [Terms of Use](https://zeetaweb.jp/terms).",
      "sortMode": "manual",
      "sortDirection": "asc"
    },
    {
      "id": "WHUvTE",
      "title": "CONTENT",
      "content": "# CONTENT\nYou can use Markdown in CONTENT. Hover over the toolbar at the top to see descriptions of its tools. Turn on “☑️markdown preview” in the header to show the preview when switching nodes.\n\nIn CONTENT (this area), you can:\n* Paste images\n* Draw diagrams with Mermaid\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A[\"Draw diagrams\"] --> B[/\"with Mermaid\"\\]\n```\n* Write HTML\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>hello</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<p>Paste HTML code</p>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\nClick each item to open it in a separate tab and view it at your preferred size.",
      "sortMode": "manual",
      "sortDirection": "asc"
    },
